<Base title="PyOrex — Geoscience tools & exploration intelligence"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Geoscience · Mineral Exploration · Open Tools</div><h1 class="display">Explore smarter.<br/>Understand deeper.</h1><p class="lead">PyOrex brings practical geoscience software and curated exploration intelligence into one open ecosystem built for geologists.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/software">Explore PyOrex Software →</a><a class="btn" href="/hub">Enter PyOrex HUB →</a></div></div></section><section class="section split"><div class="wrap grid"><article class="card product"><div class="eyebrow">01 · Software</div><h2>Tools made for geologists.</h2><p>Data analysis, diagrams, lithogeochemistry and mineral exploration workflows in a desktop application designed around real geological work.</p><a href="/software">Discover the software →</a></article><article class="card intelligence"><div class="eyebrow">02 · Intelligence</div><h2>Know what matters in exploration.</h2><p>Discoveries, papers, methods and technical insight filtered for exploration and economic geologists — without the noise.</p><a href="/hub">Open PyOrex HUB →</a></article></div></section></Base>
<style>.hero{padding:115px 0 100px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#f7f6f1 60%,#efe9cf)}.actions{margin-top:38px}.split{padding-top:20px}.card{grid-column:span 6;min-height:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}.card h2{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-.045em;max-width:480px;margin:14px 0}.card a{font-weight:800;margin-top:18px}.product{border-top:7px solid var(--yellow)}.intelligence{background:var(--hub);color:white;border-color:var(--hub)}.intelligence p{color:#c8d0ca}.intelligence .eyebrow{color:#a9b9ae}@media(max-width:760px){.hero{padding:80px 0}.card{min-height:300px}}</style>